      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name}\n\nI have prepared a world for testing.\n\nhttps://vrch.at/s7pss48z\n\nThe game object that is instantiated is a prefab containing an unsynchronized UdonBehaviour.\n\nPrefab only has UdonBehaviourSyncMode of None.\n\nHowever, it may be causing this issue because it contains a MonoBehaviour for doing processing in UnityEditor.\n\nImages are components of Prefab.\n\nDue to an issue that occurred when we moved a project currently in production to beta, we are implementing a workaround to delay initialization at this stage.\n\nThis will be supported by Google Translate. I'm sorry.",
