      "value": "@{640b9a16bd0441451927c1ba|full_name}: Okay, I have reproduced the issue on our end. Here's what seems to be happening:\n\n* `OnPlayerJoined` is called on `ClothingManager`, which instantiates a prefab with an UdonBehaviour called `Blaven Novel Tailcoat(Clone)`\n\n* It calls `_Init` on that instantiated behaviour\n\n* The instantiated behaviour runs `_Init`, and calls `DestroyImmediate(this)`\n\n* Currently: The `SendCustomEvent` call fails with an error - I will fix this in the VRChat client for this open-beta, this is a legitimate bug\n\n* With my fix applied: Execution continues, but `ClothingManager` then tries to call `SetProgramVariable` on the instantiated behaviour and fails because it destroyed itself - this looks like an error in your program logic, and not something we can fix?\n\nCan you share the source code for the script on `ClothingManager` as well as the prefab it tries to instantiate?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
