      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name}\n\nthank you. It seems there was a problem with the logic.\n\nus_playerIds is a UdonSynced variable.\n\nwhen OnPlayerJoined, myself player and object owner, RequestSerialization was not performed although it was initialized to -1.Fixed this.\n\nThen, I modified it to perform _Init only once at the OnDeserialization timing.\n\nTest: https://vrch.at/gyqxt8fp\n\nToeBone is fine. Same as Chise mall, it uses a dedicated AvatarPedestal.\n\nChise Mall: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_e39e984f-2a1e-4f1a-859d-15badca1aecb",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
