      "value": "@{640b9a16bd0441451927c1ba|full_name}: Alright, I will close out this ticket then. I'll make sure the fix for SendEvent that triggers a DestroyImmediate makes it in regardless, but otherwise your updated world seems to work just fine for me now (even on existing open-beta builds).\n\nAs for Toe bones, see my attached image, but that is outside the scope of this task, just provided as courtesy if it helps you :)",
