  "details": "When I try to Instantiate on OnPlayerJoined or Start Method, it seems to be Prefab got null exception as it seems?\n\nIf I wait few seconds with SendCustomEventDelayedSeconds, this issue seems not happening.\n\n(while delayed for 1 frame not help with issue)\n\nThis could be issue when people try to trigger event before Instantiate happen.\n\n(Can put limitation not to trigger until Instantiate but still better if not need it)\n\nIt seems to be there is no issue happen with Primitive Prefabs which I guess it is more lighter on performance.\n\nFollowing be output log which I checked.\n\n[Unknown] [UdonBehaviour] An exception occurred during Udon execution, this UdonBehaviour will be halted.\n\nVRC.Udon.VM.UdonVMException: The VM encountered an error!\n\nException Message:\n\n  An exception occurred during EXTERN to 'VRCUdonCommonInterfacesIUdonEventReceiver.__SendCustomEvent__SystemString__SystemVoid'.\n\n      Parameter Addresses: 0x000000D1, 0x00000040\n\n  \n\n  Object reference not set to an instance of an object.",
